ada"},{"text":"New Zealand"},{"text":"UAE"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Netherlands"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Possible Programmes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitality Management"},{"text":"International Hotel Management"},{"text":"Tourism Management"},{"text":"Luxury Hospitality"},{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Business"},{"text":"Revenue Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"International hotel experience can be particularly valuable for students targeting luxury hospitality and global hotel chains."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A realistic progression can be:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Tourism & Hospitality"},{"type":"h","text":"Hotel Operations Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Front Desk Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Front Office Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Front Office Supervisor"},{"type":"h","text":"Assistant Front Office Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Front Office Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Rooms Division Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Hotel Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Hotel General Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"An alternative pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Front Desk","Guest Relations","Customer Experience","Hotel Brand/Operations Management"]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Opportunities"},{"type":"p","text":"Students interested in research can explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest satisfaction"},{"text":"Hotel service quality"},{"text":"Sustainable tourism"},{"text":"Smart hotels"},{"text":"Digital check-in"},{"text":"Contactless hospitality"},{"text":"AI in hotel operations"},{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"Luxury customer behaviour"},{"text":"Hospitality workforce management"},{"text":"Tourism demand forecasting"},{"text":"Hotel sustainability"},{"text":"Accessible tourism"},{"text":"Customer experience analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential advanced research areas include AI-powered guest experience, predictive hotel demand